      "description": "\n      <h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Overview</span></h3>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">We\u2019re looking for a forward-thinking\u00a0</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">AI &amp; Workflow Developer</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">\u00a0to add to our team in this space. This is a contract opportunity with the potential to grow into a full-time role. You\u2019ll help establish Augusto\u2019s next generation of automation and AI services, working with people who have strong domain knowledge in AI and product delivery.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">This is ideal for a mid to senior-level developer who thrives on innovation, delivers independently, and is passionate about using AI tools to build practical, intelligent systems.</span></p>\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Key Responsibilities</span></h3>\n\n<ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Workflow Automation</span><ul><li>Build automation workflows using n8n.io and Python as the primary platform.</li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Integrate APIs, databases, and AI services to create functional, scalable automation pipelines.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Experience with similar tools, such as Airia.ai, Make, or Zapier, is also welcome.</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><br></span></span><br></li></ul></li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">AI Integration &amp; Prompt Engineering</span></span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Work with tools like <strong>Claude Code,</strong>\u00a0 <strong>Codex</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">\u00a0</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">GitHub Copilot</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">\u00a0to build agents, <span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">streamline development, and generate value from LLMs.</span></span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Understanding of \u00a0API and MCP services.\u00a0</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Write and test prompts that enable AI to complete meaningful tasks\u2014text classification, summarization, chatbot functionality, and more.</span></span></span></span><br><br></li></ul></li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Agent &amp; Tool Development:</span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Build task-specific AI agents or multi-step assistants powered by APIs and large language models</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Combine frontend/backend logic with AI decision-making to produce efficient microservices or tools</span></span><br><br></li></ul></li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Prototyping &amp; Delivery:</span></span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Take abstract product ideas and build working MVPs quickly, with clarity and minimal oversight</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight: