ical and non-technical stakeholders</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><br></span></span></span></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Required Skills &amp; Qualifications</span><br><br></p>\n\n<ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">AI Tool Expertise:</span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Proficiency with\u00a0</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><strong>Claude, or other LLM coding systems</strong></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Solid understanding of LLM behavior and prompt construction for a variety of tasks</span></span></span><br><br></li></ul></li><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Workflow Tooling:</span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">Hands-on experience with\u00a0</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;\">n8n (preferred)</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-we